        "english": [
          "saptāśvarathamārūḍhaṃ pracaṇḍaṃ kaśyapātmajam |",
          "śvetapadmadharaṃ devaṃ taṃ sūryaṃ praṇamāmyaham || 2 ||"
        ],
        "meaning": "I salute the Sun, who is seated on a chariot drawn by seven horses, who is very brilliant, who is the son of Kashyapa, and who holds a white lotus in his hand."
